# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Admin auth (server-checked; the password hash is never shipped to the browser)
  # These are WORKING DEFAULTS so `cp .env.example .env.local` runs out of the box.
# ROTATE THEM before going live.  See README.md → "Rotate the admin password".
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Default dev password:  uTQZ#ACbzcujiHvYKuU*-p   (change me!)
ADMIN_PASSWORD_SALT=6165cb6c648438cc8609725b512d1c5c
ADMIN_PASSWORD_HASH=be6dc0f556f05de88175955ae3039a646db8948f1508030c3be21ca36236128e

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# "GitHub as a database": admin edits are committed back to this repo file.
# GH_TOKEN = a fine-grained PAT with Contents: Read & Write on ONE repo only.
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GH_TOKEN=
GH_OWNER=
GH_REPO=
GH_BRANCH=main
GH_PATH=data/constitution.json
